  "h": "pql44d",
  "k": "<1>With children:</1> you may throw the pebbles on behalf of a small child (agreed fiqh — Ibn Majah {1} has a weak chain, its meaning is accepted) · keep them away from the Jamarat crush — one parent goes while the other waits with them · do the tawaf on the upper floor or at night.",
